# Stock-Market-Dynamics is an ORPHAN branch: `stock-market-dynamics/` is the
# only thing it tracks, and it shares no history with `main`.
#
# Switching here from main deletes main's tracked files but leaves behind
# everything main did NOT track -- build output, run directories, virtual
# environments. main's own .gitignore leaves with it, so none of that is
# hidden any more: roughly 3,300 files and 570 MB show up as plain untracked
# entries, and a reflexive `git add -A` would sweep the whole RadCluster tree
# into this history.
#
# Every rule below is anchored with a leading slash, so it matches only at the
# repository root and can never hide anything inside stock-market-dynamics/.

# RadCluster working trees left behind by a branch switch
/RadCluster_2_0/
/RadCluster_2_1/
/archive/
/docs/
/scripts/
/h2jupynb/

# Scratch and tooling
/Claude outputs/
/.claude/
/.EuroVenv/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# NOTE: *.log, *.aux, *.out and *.toc are deliberately NOT ignored here.
# Unlike the genealogy branch, this one tracks 18 such files on purpose --
# data/fetch.log, data/regimes.log and the LaTeX build products under doc/ --
# and a blanket rule would silently hide their regenerated successors.
